# Terraform state and generated files
**/.terraform/**

# Build artifacts and tooling caches
**/*.min.js
**/.conformetry
**/.nx
# Nested agent worktrees are not listed: this file's patterns match absolute
# paths, so `**/.claude/worktrees/**` ignores every file of a checkout that is
# itself a worktree, and no target here walks into `.claude/` anyway. The
# targets pass this file by absolute path for the same reason: oxlint also
# applies a relative ignore path's namesake in every ancestor directory, so a
# worktree would inherit the enclosing checkout's copy of this file.
**/.venv
**/build
**/coverage
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/tmp
**/vite.config.*.timestamp*
**/vitest.config.*.timestamp*

# Lock files and changelog
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
CHANGELOG.md

# Generated files
**/routeTree.gen.ts
applications/lexico/lexico-web/src/lib/routeTree.gen.ts
.claude/CLAUDE.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
lint-staged.config.ts
**/packages/components-web/src/components/**
**/packages/components-web/src/hooks/**
**/packages/components-web/src/lib/**

# Templates and data
**/helm/**/templates/**
**/src/modules/*/templates/**
**/applications/lexico/lexico-cli/data/**
**/applications/lexico/lexico-cli/src/modules/literature/literature.constants.ts
**/applications/lexico/lexico-cli/src/modules/library/library.constants.ts
**/library.json

# Vendored skill content (framework-managed, not codebase-authored source)
**/.agents/skills/**
**/.claude/skills/**
**/.github/skills/**
**/documentation/skills/**
